^cyan;Trade Terminal:^reset;
An automatic Trade Terminal, Connected to Titan Corp's trading network, goods can be automatically sold to Titan Corp's ^yellow;Trade Division^reset;.
^red;Currently they only accept the Bars, temporarily.^reset;
Sometimes Terminal will provide some ^yellow;Special Contracts^reset; to you.

^cyan;Hydroponic Tray:^reset;
A hydroponic tray that can grow your farmables as you provide power, seeds and water.
Also it can turn crops into seeds!
The recipes has been integrated into the machine!^blue;(experimental)^reset;
^yellow;To use this machine better, I strongly recommend you install a Food Stack Mod!

